  UpgradeDesc:
  - Bite in front of you. You are able to move while biting.
  - Shoot searing fire from your mouth, burning enemies who come into contact. you
    can also move while shooting fire.
  - Your scales grow harder and your spikes turn sharper, making you take less damage
    and inflict some back to nearby enemies.
  - Your teeth grow large, letting your bite be bigger and deal more damage.
  - you shoot out fireball now yippee
  - teeth hot
  - blue fire is hotter
  - magic fire bite because idk
  - smol fireblals
  - teeth make heal yaya
  - strongerer fire
  - idk yet
  - also idk yet
  - fire stronker and also better damage reduction and now spikes on fire yay
